            "notes": "Round 5:\n\nNow focus on more survivability during Death Blossom.\n\nPick up [Strangle Step](item_5af641ec-a231-43ea-ac83-ea15a542e03c), which gives double lifesteal after using Shadow Step. This is a huge power spike, especially when combined with your existing lifesteal.\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) remains a great pick for extra lifesteal and overheal, making you much tankier. With double lifesteal from [Strangle Step](item_5af641ec-a231-43ea-ac83-ea15a542e03c) the 100 overheal is almost always active.\n\nAlso pick [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98), or if enemy healing is a problem [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505).",
